   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Good Times**: back after 51 archived shows (507 days); rare: 7 archived performances [7]\n- **Dark Star V1**: rare: 12 archived performances [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2023-01-16.EJL95** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 193 min; rated 4.6/5 by 5 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer disputes that John Mayer leaving is why Dead & Company are ending and asks for a sourced quote [3]\n- Reviewer frames this show as the start of Dead & Company's final tour and a look at John Mayer's later years with the band [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2023-01-16.EJL95**: taped by Eric Lugassy; transferred by Eric Lugassy; source: Source: Channels 1 & 2 Line Audio OM1 Omnis 32\" Apart 90deg Left/ Right// Channels 3 & 4 Vanguard V1 Hypercardiods X/Y Center Channel // Chanel 5 & 6 Audio… [1]. Also: Recorded with OM1 omnis, Vanguard V1 hypercardioids and Audio Technica AT3031 cardioids into a Zoom F6 at 32-bit float, with wind protection [1]",
